    "stopping_rule": "One build and fixed collection; retain all traces and failures. Do not add groups or select inputs based on outcomes. Finish validation before collection and do not overlap other machine work.",
    "limits": [
      "This changes cold resolver destruction in a diagnostic build; both modes explicitly remove entries through retain. It does not reproduce the original implicit Drop byte for byte.",
